{"title":"蓝桥杯真题：串的处理","slug":"2024-04-08-串的处理","date":"2024-04-08T00:10:52.000Z","updated":"2024-04-08T00:10:52.000Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/2024-04-08-串的处理.json","excerpt":null,"covers":null,"content":"<span id=\"more\"></span>\n<h2 id=\"题目描述\"><a href=\"#题目描述\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"题目描述\"></a>题目描述</h2><p>在实际的开发工作中，对字符串的处理是最常见的编程任务之一。本题要求编写程序，对用户输入的字符串进行特定规则的处理。</p>\n<p><strong>具体处理规则如下：</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>首字母大写</strong>：将每个单词的首字母转换为大写。</li>\n<li><strong>数字字母分隔</strong>：在数字与字母之间插入下划线字符 <code>_</code>，以增强可读性（需同时考虑“字母在前，数字在后”和“数字在前，字母在后”两种情况）。</li>\n<li><strong>空格规范化</strong>：将单词间的一个或多个空格调整为 <strong>1个</strong> 空格。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"输入描述\"><a href=\"#输入描述\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"输入描述\"></a>输入描述</h2><p>用户输入的字符串仅包含 <strong>小写字母</strong>、<strong>空格</strong> 和 <strong>数字</strong>，不含其他字符。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>单词间由 1 个或多个空格分隔。</li>\n<li>输入字符串长度不超过 200 个字符。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"输出描述\"><a href=\"#输出描述\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"输出描述\"></a>输出描述</h2><p>输出经过上述规则处理后的字符串。</p>\n<h2 id=\"解题思路\"><a href=\"#解题思路\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"解题思路\"></a>解题思路</h2><p>本题考察字符串的基本操作，包括分割、遍历、类型判断与拼接。我们可以将问题拆解为以下三个步骤：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>空格规范化</strong>：利用 Python 的 <code>split()</code> 方法不带参数的特性，自动将字符串按空白字符（包括多个空格、制表符等）分割成单词列表，同时去除了多余的空格。</li>\n<li><strong>数字字母分隔</strong>：遍历每个单词的字符。检查当前字符与下一个字符的类型，如果一个是数字一个是字母，则插入下划线。这里需要注意遍历的边界，避免索引越界。</li>\n<li><strong>首字母大写</strong>：在完成上述处理后，利用字符串的 <code>upper()</code> 方法将单词首字母大写，最后用 <code>join()</code> 方法将列表重新拼接成字符串。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\"><a href=\"#代码实现\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"代码实现\"></a>代码实现</h2><p>以下是基于 Python 的完整代码实现：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br><span class=\"line\">29</span><br><span class=\"line\">30</span><br><span class=\"line\">31</span><br><span class=\"line\">32</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 读取输入并直接去除多余空格，分割为单词列表</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">s = <span class=\"built_in\">input</span>().split()</span><br><span class=\"line\">l_new = []</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">for</span> word <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> s:</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 将单词转换为字符列表以便处理</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    chars = <span class=\"built_in\">list</span>(word)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    temp_str = <span class=\"string\">&quot;&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    </span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 遍历单词中的每一个字符（不包括最后一个，避免越界）</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> j <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(<span class=\"built_in\">len</span>(chars) - <span class=\"number\">1</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">        temp_str += chars[j]</span><br><span class=\"line\">        </span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"comment\"># 判断当前字符与下一个字符是否为“数字+字母”或“字母+数字”的关系</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> chars[j].isdigit() <span class=\"keyword\">and</span> chars[j+<span class=\"number\">1</span>].isalpha():</span><br><span class=\"line\">            temp_str += <span class=\"string\">&#x27;_&#x27;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> chars[j].isalpha() <span class=\"keyword\">and</span> chars[j+<span class=\"number\">1</span>].isdigit():</span><br><span class=\"line\">            temp_str += <span class=\"string\">&#x27;_&#x27;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">            </span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 拼接单词的最后一个字符</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    temp_str += chars[-<span class=\"number\">1</span>]</span><br><span class=\"line\">    </span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 将处理好的单词加入新列表</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    l_new.append(temp_str)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 遍历列表，将每个单词首字母大写，并用空格连接</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">result = <span class=\"string\">&quot; &quot;</span>.join([word[<span class=\"number\">0</span>].upper() + word[<span class=\"number\">1</span>:] <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> word <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> l_new])</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(result)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">## 复杂度分析</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">- **时间复杂度**：$O(N)$，其中 $N$ 是输入字符串的长度。我们需要遍历字符串中的每个字符进行判断和拼接。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- **空间复杂度**：$O(N)$，需要额外的空间存储分割后的单词列表和处理后的字符串。</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>","more":"<h2 id=\"题目描述\"><a href=\"#题目描述\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"题目描述\"></a>题目描述</h2><p>在实际的开发工作中，对字符串的处理是最常见的编程任务之一。本题要求编写程序，对用户输入的字符串进行特定规则的处理。</p>\n<p><strong>具体处理规则如下：</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>首字母大写</strong>：将每个单词的首字母转换为大写。</li>\n<li><strong>数字字母分隔</strong>：在数字与字母之间插入下划线字符 <code>_</code>，以增强可读性（需同时考虑“字母在前，数字在后”和“数字在前，字母在后”两种情况）。</li>\n<li><strong>空格规范化</strong>：将单词间的一个或多个空格调整为 <strong>1个</strong> 空格。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"输入描述\"><a href=\"#输入描述\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"输入描述\"></a>输入描述</h2><p>用户输入的字符串仅包含 <strong>小写字母</strong>、<strong>空格</strong> 和 <strong>数字</strong>，不含其他字符。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>单词间由 1 个或多个空格分隔。</li>\n<li>输入字符串长度不超过 200 个字符。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"输出描述\"><a href=\"#输出描述\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"输出描述\"></a>输出描述</h2><p>输出经过上述规则处理后的字符串。</p>\n<h2 id=\"解题思路\"><a href=\"#解题思路\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"解题思路\"></a>解题思路</h2><p>本题考察字符串的基本操作，包括分割、遍历、类型判断与拼接。我们可以将问题拆解为以下三个步骤：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>空格规范化</strong>：利用 Python 的 <code>split()</code> 方法不带参数的特性，自动将字符串按空白字符（包括多个空格、制表符等）分割成单词列表，同时去除了多余的空格。</li>\n<li><strong>数字字母分隔</strong>：遍历每个单词的字符。检查当前字符与下一个字符的类型，如果一个是数字一个是字母，则插入下划线。这里需要注意遍历的边界，避免索引越界。</li>\n<li><strong>首字母大写</strong>：在完成上述处理后，利用字符串的 <code>upper()</code> 方法将单词首字母大写，最后用 <code>join()</code> 方法将列表重新拼接成字符串。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\"><a href=\"#代码实现\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"代码实现\"></a>代码实现</h2><p>以下是基于 Python 的完整代码实现：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br><span class=\"line\">29</span><br><span class=\"line\">30</span><br><span class=\"line\">31</span><br><span class=\"line\">32</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 读取输入并直接去除多余空格，分割为单词列表</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">s = <span class=\"built_in\">input</span>().split()</span><br><span class=\"line\">l_new = []</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">for</span> word <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> s:</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 将单词转换为字符列表以便处理</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    chars = <span class=\"built_in\">list</span>(word)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    temp_str = <span class=\"string\">&quot;&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    </span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 遍历单词中的每一个字符（不包括最后一个，避免越界）</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> j <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(<span class=\"built_in\">len</span>(chars) - <span class=\"number\">1</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">        temp_str += chars[j]</span><br><span class=\"line\">        </span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"comment\"># 判断当前字符与下一个字符是否为“数字+字母”或“字母+数字”的关系</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> chars[j].isdigit() <span class=\"keyword\">and</span> chars[j+<span class=\"number\">1</span>].isalpha():</span><br><span class=\"line\">            temp_str += <span class=\"string\">&#x27;_&#x27;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> chars[j].isalpha() <span class=\"keyword\">and</span> chars[j+<span class=\"number\">1</span>].isdigit():</span><br><span class=\"line\">            temp_str += <span class=\"string\">&#x27;_&#x27;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">            </span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 拼接单词的最后一个字符</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    temp_str += chars[-<span class=\"number\">1</span>]</span><br><span class=\"line\">    </span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 将处理好的单词加入新列表</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    l_new.append(temp_str)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 遍历列表，将每个单词首字母大写，并用空格连接</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">result = <span class=\"string\">&quot; &quot;</span>.join([word[<span class=\"number\">0</span>].upper() + word[<span class=\"number\">1</span>:] <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> word <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> l_new])</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(result)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">## 复杂度分析</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">- **时间复杂度**：$O(N)$，其中 $N$ 是输入字符串的长度。我们需要遍历字符串中的每个字符进行判断和拼接。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- **空间复杂度**：$O(N)$，需要额外的空间存储分割后的单词列表和处理后的字符串。</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>","categories":[{"name":"算法刷题","path":"api/categories/算法刷题.json"}],"tags":[{"name":"Python","path":"api/tags/Python.json"},{"name":"算法","path":"api/tags/算法.json"},{"name":"LanQiao","path":"api/tags/LanQiao.json"}]}